    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0873_ST02_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Over here, the building with the blue\n",
        "roof is the Poké Mart.\r",
        "It’s a shop where you can buy and\n",
        "sell all sorts of items.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, since you’re a rookie\n",
        "Trainer, you won’t be able to buy\\fvery much stuff.\r",
        "Don’t worry about it, OK?\r"
