    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0873_ST02_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, yeah, right!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "You should let your family know\n",
        "you’re helping Prof. Rowan put\\ftogether his Pokédex.\r",
